# Portfolio safety

- No secrets in git: use `.env.example` and GitHub Actions `secrets.REQRES_API_KEY` only.
- No employer/client confidential data, internal URLs, or real banking/trade data in tests or docs.
- No personal phone, home address, or CV files in public commits.
- Work on `chore/portfolio-polish-*` branches; merge only when CI is green.
- README test counts must match `mvn test` output (do not invent numbers).
